<title>DENMARK: Danish travel agents to boycott SAS.</title>
<headline>Danish travel agents to boycott SAS.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish business travel agents said on Friday that they were launching a boycott of Scandinavian Airlines System (SAS) in protest at its decision to cut agents' commissions on domestic and intra-Scandinavian flights.</p>
<p>The seven Danish members of the Guild of European Business Travel Agents said in a statement that as far as possible they would book clients on SAS' competitors until further notice. --Per Bech Thomsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969656</p>
</text>
